OL,3,GNEWSA'Soul destroying' parking charge
OL,4,Arise to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FParking charge rises set to come in
OL,7,Ffrom this month in Liverpool have been
OL,8,Fbranded as "soul-destroying" by people
OL,9,Fwho claim their livelihoods will be
OL,10,Faffected by them.
OL,12,FThe cost of parking a car in the city
OL,13,Fcentre is to rise again later this
OL,14,Fmonth, with Liverpool City Council
OL,15,Fsaying the cost of leaving a car for
OL,16,Fhalf an hour within the inner city
OL,17,Fcentre is to go up to #2.40, and an
OL,18,Fhour will increase to #4.60.
OL,20,FChef Paul Askew, who runs a city centre
OL,21,Frestaurant, said: "It is another death
OL,22,Fknell for hospitality."
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
