OL,3,GNEWSA'Soul destroying' parking charge
OL,4,Arise to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuth Bennett, the council's deputy
OL,7,Fleader, said fees were being
OL,8,F"continually monitored" so they
OL,9,F"remained competitive".
